0}],"sections":[{"heading":"History","level":2,"wikitext":"He and [[Mr. Steel]] attempted to retrieve [[Eathon Lambert's journal]]. However, they was no match for [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nHe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante Vale, Lok Lambert, and Sophie Casterwill in the Venice Huntik Library. This Suit, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}","text":"He and Mr. Steel attempted to retrieve Eathon Lambert's journal. However, they was no match for Sophie Casterwill. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nHe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante Vale, Lok Lambert, and Sophie Casterwill in the Venice Huntik Library. This Suit, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. [The Casterwill Client]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]] and spells.\n\n{{Col-begin}}\n{{Col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Hyperstride]] \n* [[Raypulse]]\n\n{{Col-2}}","text":"* Augerfrost\n* Hyperstride \n* Raypulse"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Redcap]]\n\n{{Col-end}}","text":"* Redcap"},{"heading":"Gallery","level":2,"wikitext":"<gallery position=\"center\">\nS1E2 Unnamed Suit 002 and Mr Koskin.jpeg|Casting [[Augerfrost]] with [[Mr. Koskin]]\nFile:Unnamed Suit 002.png\nSuit 3.jpg\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"S1E2 Unnamed Suit 002 and Mr Koskin.jpeg|Casting Augerfrost with Mr. Koskin\nFile:Unnamed Suit 002.png\nSuit 3.jpg"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 002 is a Suit working for the Organization, previously commanded by DeFoe. He is one of the agents stationed in Venice, Italy.\n\n== History ==\nHe and Mr. Steel attempted to retrieve Eathon Lambert's journal. However, they was no match for Sophie Casterwill. [A Seeker Is Born]\n\nHe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante Vale, Lok Lambert, and Sophie Casterwill in the Venice Huntik Library. This Suit, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. [The Casterwill Client]\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans and spells.\n\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* Augerfrost\n* Hyperstride \n* Raypulse\n\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* Redcap\n\n== Gallery ==\n\nS1E2 Unnamed Suit 002 and Mr Koskin.jpeg|Casting Augerfrost with Mr. Koskin\nFile:Unnamed Suit 002.png\nSuit 3.jpg","raw_wikitext":"{{Infobox character\n| image  = File:Suit 3.jpg\n| group  = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br>[[Suits]]\n| base   = [[Venice, Italy]]<br>[[Prague, Czech Republic]]\n| gender = Male\n| hair   = Red-brown\n| eyes   = Dark Green\n| first  = \"[[A Seeker Is Born]]\"\n|american=Michael Sinterniklaas}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 002''' is a [[Suit]] working for [[the Organization]], previously commanded by [[DeFoe]]. He is one of the agents stationed in [[Venice, Italy]].\n\n== History ==\nHe and [[Mr. Steel]] attempted to retrieve [[Eathon Lambert's journal]]. However, they was no match for [[Sophie Casterwill]]. {{Source|A Seeker Is Born}}\n\nHe was one of the many Suits called in by DeFoe to stop Dante Vale, Lok Lambert, and Sophie Casterwill in the Venice Huntik Library. This Suit, along with the others, was defeated by Dante's team and Santiago. {{source|The Casterwill Client}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]] and spells.\n\n{{Col-begin}}\n{{Col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Hyperstride]] \n* [[Raypulse]]\n\n{{Col-2}}\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* [[Redcap]]\n\n{{Col-end}}\n\n== Gallery ==\n<gallery position=\"center\">\nS1E2 Unnamed Suit 002 and Mr Koskin.jpeg|Casting [[Augerfrost]] with [[Mr. Koskin]]\nFile:Unnamed Suit 002.png\nSuit 3.jpg\n</gallery>\n[[Category:Characters]]\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_id":"huntik:page:8056","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Venice%2C_Italy","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Venice%2C%20Italy"},{"target_title":"Prague, Czech Republic","label":"Prague, Czech Republic","target_id":"huntik:page:8072","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Prague%2C_Czech_Republic","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Prague%2C%20Czech%20Republic"},{"target_title":"A Seeker Is Born","label":"A Seeker Is Born","target_id":"huntik:page:2257","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/A_Seeker_Is_Born","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2257"},{"target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_id":"huntik:page:2050","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_id":"huntik:page:1990","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_title":"DeFoe","label":"DeFoe","target_id":"huntik:page:2048","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/DeFoe","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2048"},{"target_title":"Venice, Italy","label":"Venice, Italy","target_id":"huntik:page:8056","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.c